export anchor StatusColumnsStyle:
    number: 182
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Status columns
    idea: A portfolio board on white, where three status columns, On track, At risk and Behind, hold the project cards, a charcoal icon rail and charcoal type carry the structure, and soft status tints only mark the column heads.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page and cards
        well: #f5f6f7, column bodies and initials tiles
        charcoal: #2a2c30, the rail, the primary button and progress fills
        ink: #202124, text, heavy rules and focus
        muted: #585c64, labels and meta
        line: #dcdee1, card edges and rules
        fieldEdge: #8a8e95, inputs and search
        greyLine: #80848c, the last week line in the chart
        onTint: #e5f2e8, the On track column head, with #1d6a37 for its text, shape and top rule
        riskTint: #fbefd9, the At risk column head, with #875000
        behindTint: #fbe4e2, the Behind column head, with #ad261f, also the overdue text
    type:
        One stack, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, system-ui. The
        greeting 28px at 800 with minus 0.02em tracking, KPI figures 26px
        at 800, card titles 16px bold, column heads 15px at 800, body 14px,
        card fact labels 11px caps tracked 0.06em.
    layout:
        A 76px charcoal rail at left holds a white square B mark and six
        nav items as icons with small labels underneath, Home as a white
        tile. The top bar on white has the bold wordmark, a square search
        field, then at right a charcoal New project button, a square bell
        with a red dot and a square initials tile with Mara Okafor. The
        intro row has the greeting and the date with a red clock and 4
        tasks are overdue at left and four figures at right split by thin
        rules, closed by a 2px ink rule. The board is a three column grid.
        On track spans both rows of column one. At risk and Behind sit at
        the top of columns two and three. Each column has a 4px top rule
        and a tinted head with the filled shape, the word and a count box,
        a pale well holding white cards, and a footer of done over total
        tasks. A card shows team and percent, the project name, a thin
        charcoal bar, Tasks, Due and Left facts and the latest event for
        that project when one exists. Under At risk sits Tasks completed as
        a line chart by weekday, a solid line with dots for this week and a
        dashed grey line with square markers for last week. Under Behind
        sits Activity as rows of initials tile, sentence and time. Below
        1080px the board is two columns, and below 760px everything stacks
        and the rail becomes a top strip.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between columns, 10px between cards, 12 by 14px card padding, 28px page gutter.
    density: Medium. Status is read from column position, details from small cards.
    corners: 2px everywhere, nearly square.
    borders: 1px #dcdee1 cards, a 4px status rule on each column top, a 2px ink rule under the intro and under the sheet.
    shadows: Only a 1px bottom line at 4 percent black under cards.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.8px stroke, 22px on the rail with labels. Filled
        status shapes in the column heads and rows, a check circle for On
        track, a triangle with a bang for At risk and a crossed square for
        Behind.
    focus: A 2px ink outline offset 2px, white on the rail.
    tone: Direct portfolio language with short labels, such as Left 20 d.
